        "product_summary": "Dial and cord closure: A side dial operates the cord guides across the instep, offering an alternative to tying traditional shoelaces.\n\nMesh-panel upper: A visible mesh forefoot and side panels sit beneath layered cutout overlays, giving the sneaker an open-texture athletic look.\n\nSculpted sole profile: Angular sidewall details and a contrasting heel insert define the shape. Actual outsole photographs show the bottom pattern.\n\nTwo colour directions: White/Navy and White/Orange are listed in EU39-44. The two options share the same dial system and shoe structure.\n\nWholesale assortment: Send colour-size quantities, packing preference and destination for an order quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
